		{"id":"g_s3","type":"group","x":960,"y":-120,"width":540,"height":560,"label":"🏬 Silo (S3)"},
		{"id":"g_lk","type":"group","x":460,"y":-120,"width":420,"height":560,"color":"5","label":"📒 Lakekeeper (каталог)"},
		{"id":"g_ws","type":"group","x":0,"y":-120,"width":380,"height":560,"label":"📦 workspace"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Хранилище курса: S3 → Parquet → Iceberg → каталог\nУрок: [04 · S3, Parquet, Iceberg и каталог](../theory/04_s3_iceberg_catalog.md) · Аналогия: склад коробок ([S3](../../../glossary/s3.md)), коробки по столбцам ([Parquet](../../../glossary/parquet.md)), опись ([Iceberg](../../../glossary/iceberg.md)), картотека и бюро пропусков ([каталог](../../../glossary/iceberg-catalog.md)).","x":0,"y":-300,"width":1500,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"env","type":"text","text":"**Переменные**\n`S3_ENDPOINT=http://silo:9000`\n`AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`, `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`","x":20,"y":-80,"width":340,"height":110},
		{"id":"ptr","type":"text","text":"**Указатели** в Postgres\n`_demo.sales → metadata/00002-….json`\nатомарный commit = транзакция","x":480,"y":-80,"width":380,"height":110},
		{"id":"wh","type":"text","text":"**Warehouse `lakehouse`**\nstorage-profile: `silo:9000`, бакет `warehouse`, `sts-enabled`\nstorage-credential: root-ключи (зашифрованы)","x":480,"y":70,"width":380,"height":150},
		{"id":"land","type":"text","text":"**бакет landing** — сырые файлы\n`freshretail/2026-09-28/sales.parquet` (папок нет — это ключ)","x":980,"y":-80,"width":500,"height":90},
		{"id":"whb","type":"text","text":"**бакет warehouse / lakehouse / <uuid таблицы>/**\n\n`metadata/00002-….metadata.json` ← текущий\n`metadata/00001-…`, `00000-…` ← прошлые версии\n`metadata/snap-….avro` ← manifest list (версия)\n`metadata/…-m0.avro` ← manifest (файлы + min/max)\n`data/….parquet` ← строки по столбцам, ZSTD\n\n[snapshot](../../../glossary/snapshot.md): каждая запись = новая версия, старые файлы не меняются","x":980,"y":40,"width":500,"height":380},
		{"id":"note","type":"text","text":"Ошибка в переменных ломает только ①","x":20,"y":360,"width":340,"height":60},
		{"id":"sts","type":"text","text":"**Vended credentials**\nAssumeRole (STS) root-ключом → временные ключи на 3600 с\n→ клиенту: `s3.endpoint` + ключи\n[vended credentials](../../../glossary/vended-credentials.md)","x":480,"y":250,"width":380,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"direct","type":"text","text":"**① Прямой путь**\ns3fs · dlt · boto3 · `check_s3`\nадрес и ключи — свои","x":20,"y":70,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"cat_cl","type":"text","text":"**② Через каталог**\nPyIceberg · DuckDB · `check_iceberg_and_duckdb`\nзнает только `ICEBERG_CATALOG_URI`","x":20,"y":215,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"5"}
	],
